sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Event as Event
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Event: cancel(reason)
    Note over Event: Policies: eventRead, eventWrite, eventExecute
    Note over Event: Guards (3)
    Event->>Event: guard[0]: self.stage == #quot;planning#quot; or self.stage == #quot;pending_approv...
    Event->>Event: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Event->>Event: guard[2]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;eventManageAccess#quot;)
    Event->>Event: mutate.stage
    Event->>Event: mutate.cancellationReason
    Event->>Event: mutate.cancelledAt
    Event->>EventBus: emit EventCancelled on event.cancelled
    Event-->>-Client: void